    "Caribou Creek CG, NT, Canada",
    "Destination:",
    "Tsiigehtchic, NT, Canada",
    "Camp or Hotel:",
    "camp",
    "Miles:",
    "49",
    "Great ride, long, straight road tough the swamps. Olive came by - she has our box of food for Eagle Plains Hotel, so that's all well. Muriel and Alan came by and treated us to lunch in their RV. We were worried about getting across on the ferry at Tsiigehtchic, but it runs until midnight. On the boat, the manager was Russell Andre. We asked him where we might be able to get a shower - and he invited us to his house. Nobody's home, he said, but go on in and have a shower! We camped by the church overlooking the rivers.",
    "trip:",
    "Inuvik to Denver",
    "vid:",
    "1042"
